<!-- THE NIGHTLY COMPS REBUILD — the schedule, as a file. NOT INSTALLED: the name ends in .NOT-INSTALLED so launchd cannot load it
     by accident, and it sits in the repo, not in ~/Library/LaunchAgents. To install, see DESIGN.md; to remove, ROLLBACK.md.
     Three starts on market days, each a no-op once the night is built (the lock and the settle check decide):
       18:30 and 21:00 New York time, and 07:30 the next morning as the catch-up (the pattern of the Hub's own sigma-daily pair).
     launchd runs a missed StartCalendarInterval start when the Mac wakes (man launchd.plist). Times are the Mac's local time. -->
